1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:04,446
I'm invisible!
Totally invisible!

2
00:00:07,316 --> 00:00:09,137
You look better.

3
00:00:09,177 --> 00:00:13,756
Rude.
Now... the city is mine.

4
00:00:16,672 --> 00:00:17,896
Boo!

5
00:00:17,936 --> 00:00:20,334
Bus is late again.

6
00:00:20,374 --> 00:00:22,251
I'm a floating coat!

7
00:00:22,291 --> 00:00:24,168
Nice coat.

8
00:00:24,208 --> 00:00:25,589
Fear me!

9
00:00:25,629 --> 00:00:26,889
Here.

10
00:00:26,929 --> 00:00:29,026
...Thank you.

11
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:32,087
AAAH! A FACE!

12
00:00:32,127 --> 00:00:33,885
Seriously?

13
00:00:34,983 --> 00:00:38,021
Told you.
You looked better.
